('3bc13ec5-8fb1-40ee-9ac0-a79b598cebcf'::uuid,'10A1',10,'Q17','Use the properties of 45°–45°–90° and 30°–60°–90° triangles','استعمال خصائص المثلثات ٤٥°–٤٥°–٩٠° و٣٠°–٦٠°–٩٠°','184 (Q19–25); 185 (Q33–38)',13,3,'3bc13ec5-8fb1-40ee-9ac0-a79b598cebcf'::uuid),
