('10a1-w10-p184-q23',$question_json${"id":"10a1-w10-p184-q23","classroom":"10A1","examWeek":10,"exam":"10A1 · 10th week practice","topic":"Use the properties of 45°–45°–90° and 30°–60°–90° triangles","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Find x and y in the diagram. Give exact values; any variable marked ° is an angle in degrees.","promptAr":"أوجد x وy في الرسم بالقيم الدقيقة. كل متغير معلم بالرمز ° يمثل زاوية بالدرجات.","answer":"Use the ratio 1:1:√2 for a 45°–45°–90° triangle, or 1:√3:2 for a 30°–60°–90° triangle, matching sides to the marked angles. Therefore $x=24\\sqrt3$ and $y=48$.","answerAr":"نستعمل النسبة $1:1:\\sqrt2$ للمثلث $45^\\circ,45^\\circ,90^\\circ$ أو $1:\\sqrt3:2$ للمثلث $30^\\circ,60^\\circ,90^\\circ$، مع مطابقة الأضلاع للزوايا. النتيجة $x=24\\sqrt3$ و$y=48$.","options":["$\\begin{gathered}x=24\\sqrt3\\\\y=96\\end{gathered}$","$\\begin{gathered}x=24\\sqrt3\\\\y=48\\end{gathered}$","$\\begin{gathered}x=48\\\\y=24\\sqrt3\\end{gathered}$","$\\begin{gathered}x=48\\sqrt3\\\\y=48\\end{gathered}$"],"optionsAr":["$\\begin{gathered}x=24\\sqrt3\\\\y=96\\end{gathered}$","$\\begin{gathered}x=24\\sqrt3\\\\y=48\\end{gathered}$","$\\begin{gathered}x=48\\\\y=24\\sqrt3\\end{gathered}$","$\\begin{gathered}x=48\\sqrt3\\\\y=48\\end{gathered}$"],"sourcePage":184,"sourceQuestion":23,"rightTriangleDiagram":{"kind":"right","legs":[24,41.569219381653056],"labels":["24","x","y"],"angleC":30},"specialTriangle":{"expected":[41.569219381653056,48],"choiceValues":[[41.569219381653056,96],[41.569219381653056,48],[48,41.569219381653056],[83.13843876330611,48]]},"correctIndex":1}$question_json$::jsonb),
