('10a1-w10-p185-q34',$question_json${"id":"10a1-w10-p185-q34","classroom":"10A1","examWeek":10,"exam":"10A1 · 10th week practice","topic":"Use the properties of 45°–45°–90° and 30°–60°–90° triangles","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Find x and y in the diagram. Give exact values; any variable marked ° is an angle in degrees.","promptAr":"أوجد x وy في الرسم بالقيم الدقيقة. كل متغير معلم بالرمز ° يمثل زاوية بالدرجات.","answer":"Use the ratio 1:1:√2 for a 45°–45°–90° triangle, or 1:√3:2 for a 30°–60°–90° triangle, matching sides to the marked angles. Therefore $x=3\\sqrt2$ and $y=6\\sqrt2$.","answerAr":"نستعمل النسبة $1:1:\\sqrt2$ للمثلث $45^\\circ,45^\\circ,90^\\circ$ أو $1:\\sqrt3:2$ للمثلث $30^\\circ,60^\\circ,90^\\circ$، مع مطابقة الأضلاع للزوايا. النتيجة $x=3\\sqrt2$ و$y=6\\sqrt2$.","options":["$\\begin{gathered}x=3\\sqrt2\\\\y=6\\sqrt2\\end{gathered}$","$\\begin{gathered}x=6\\sqrt2\\\\y=3\\sqrt2\\end{gathered}$","$\\begin{gathered}x=6\\sqrt2\\\\y=6\\sqrt2\\end{gathered}$","$\\begin{gathered}x=3\\sqrt2\\\\y=12\\sqrt2\\end{gathered}$"],"optionsAr":["$\\begin{gathered}x=3\\sqrt2\\\\y=6\\sqrt2\\end{gathered}$","$\\begin{gathered}x=6\\sqrt2\\\\y=3\\sqrt2\\end{gathered}$","$\\begin{gathered}x=6\\sqrt2\\\\y=6\\sqrt2\\end{gathered}$","$\\begin{gathered}x=3\\sqrt2\\\\y=12\\sqrt2\\end{gathered}$"],"sourcePage":185,"sourceQuestion":34,"rightTriangleDiagram":{"kind":"special34"},"specialTriangle":{"expected":[4.242640687119286,8.485281374238571],"choiceValues":[[4.242640687119286,8.485281374238571],[8.485281374238571,4.242640687119286],[8.485281374238571,8.485281374238571],[4.242640687119286,16.970562748477143]]},"correctIndex":0}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10a1-w10-p185-q35',$question_json${"id":"10a1-w10-p185-q35","classroom":"10A1","examWeek":10,"exam":"10A1 · 10th week practice","topic":"Use the properties of 45°–45°–90° and 30°–60°–90° triangles","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Find x and y in the diagram. Give exact values; any variable marked ° is an angle in degrees.","promptAr":"أوجد x وy في الرسم بالقيم الدقيقة. كل متغير معلم بالرمز ° يمثل زاوية بالدرجات.","answer":"Use the 30°–60°–90° ratio to get hypotenuse 4; the hypotenuse projections are 3 and 1. Therefore $x=3$ and $y=1$.","answerAr":"نستعمل النسبة $1:1:\\sqrt2$ للمثلث $45^\\circ,45^\\circ,90^\\circ$ أو $1:\\sqrt3:2$ للمثلث $30^\\circ,60^\\circ,90^\\circ$، مع مطابقة الأضلاع للزوايا. النتيجة $x=3$ و$y=1$.","options":["$\\begin{gathered}x=3\\\\y=2\\end{gathered}$","$\\begin{gathered}x=3\\\\y=1\\end{gathered}$","$\\begin{gathered}x=1\\\\y=3\\end{gathered}$","$\\begin{gathered}x=6\\\\y=1\\end{gathered}$"],"optionsAr":["$\\begin{gathered}x=3\\\\y=2\\end{gathered}$","$\\begin{gathered}x=3\\\\y=1\\end{gathered}$","$\\begin{gathered}x=1\\\\y=3\\end{gathered}$","$\\begin{gathered}x=6\\\\y=1\\end{gathered}$"],"sourcePage":185,"sourceQuestion":35,"rightTriangleDiagram":{"kind":"special35"},"specialTriangle":{"expected":[3,1],"choiceValues":[[3,2],[3,1],[1,3],[6,1]]},"correctIndex":1}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10a1-w10-p185-q36',$question_json${"id":"10a1-w10-p185-q36","classroom":"10A1","examWeek":10,"exam":"10A1 · 10th week practice","topic":"Use the properties of 45°–45°–90° and 30°–60°–90° triangles","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Find x and y in the diagram. Give exact values; any variable marked ° is an angle in degrees.","promptAr":"أوجد x وy في الرسم بالقيم الدقيقة. كل متغير معلم بالرمز ° يمثل زاوية بالدرجات.","answer":"Use the ratio 1:1:√2 for a 45°–45°–90° triangle, or 1:√3:2 for a 30°–60°–90° triangle, matching sides to the marked angles. Therefore $x=5$ and $y=10$.","answerAr":"نستعمل النسبة $1:1:\\sqrt2$ للمثلث $45^\\circ,45^\\circ,90^\\circ$ أو $1:\\sqrt3:2$ للمثلث $30^\\circ,60^\\circ,90^\\circ$، مع مطابقة الأضلاع للزوايا. النتيجة $x=5$ و$y=10$.","options":["$\\begin{gathered}x=10\\\\y=10\\end{gathered}$","$\\begin{gathered}x=5\\\\y=20\\end{gathered}$","$\\begin{gathered}x=5\\\\y=10\\end{gathered}$","$\\begin{gathered}x=10\\\\y=5\\end{gathered}$"],"optionsAr":["$\\begin{gathered}x=10\\\\y=10\\end{gathered}$","$\\begin{gathered}x=5\\\\y=20\\end{gathered}$","$\\begin{gathered}x=5\\\\y=10\\end{gathered}$","$\\begin{gathered}x=10\\\\y=5\\end{gathered}$"],"sourcePage":185,"sourceQuestion":36,"rightTriangleDiagram":{"kind":"special36"},"specialTriangle":{"expected":[5,10],"choiceValues":[[10,10],[5,20],[5,10],[10,5]]},"correctIndex":2}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10a1-w10-p185-q37',$question_json${"id":"10a1-w10-p185-q37","classroom":"10A1","examWeek":10,"exam":"10A1 · 10th week practice","topic":"Use the properties of 45°–45°–90° and 30°–60°–90° triangles","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Find x and y in the diagram. Give exact values; any variable marked ° is an angle in degrees.","promptAr":"أوجد x وy في الرسم بالقيم الدقيقة. كل متغير معلم بالرمز ° يمثل زاوية بالدرجات.","answer":"The altitude theorem gives y=(3√3)²/9=3. The hypotenuse is 12, so x²=12×9=108. Therefore $x=6\\sqrt3$ and $y=3$.","answerAr":"نستعمل النسبة $1:1:\\sqrt2$ للمثلث $45^\\circ,45^\\circ,90^\\circ$ أو $1:\\sqrt3:2$ للمثلث $30^\\circ,60^\\circ,90^\\circ$، مع مطابقة الأضلاع للزوايا. النتيجة $x=6\\sqrt3$ و$y=3$.","options":["$\\begin{gathered}x=3\\\\y=6\\sqrt3\\end{gathered}$","$\\begin{gathered}x=12\\sqrt3\\\\y=3\\end{gathered}$","$\\begin{gathered}x=6\\sqrt3\\\\y=6\\end{gathered}$","$\\begin{gathered}x=6\\sqrt3\\\\y=3\\end{gathered}$"],"optionsAr":["$\\begin{gathered}x=3\\\\y=6\\sqrt3\\end{gathered}$","$\\begin{gathered}x=12\\sqrt3\\\\y=3\\end{gathered}$","$\\begin{gathered}x=6\\sqrt3\\\\y=6\\end{gathered}$","$\\begin{gathered}x=6\\sqrt3\\\\y=3\\end{gathered}$"],"sourcePage":185,"sourceQuestion":37,"rightTriangleDiagram":{"kind":"special37"},"specialTriangle":{"expected":[10.392304845413264,3],"choiceValues":[[3,10.392304845413264],[20.784609690826528,3],[10.392304845413264,6],[10.392304845413264,3]]},"correctIndex":3}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10a1-w10-p185-q38',$question_json${"id":"10a1-w10-p185-q38","classroom":"10A1","examWeek":10,"exam":"10A1 · 10th week practice","topic":"Use the properties of 45°–45°–90° and 30°–60°–90° triangles","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Find x and y in the diagram. Give exact values; any variable marked ° is an angle in degrees.","promptAr":"أوجد x وy في الرسم بالقيم الدقيقة. كل متغير معلم بالرمز ° يمثل زاوية بالدرجات.","answer":"Use the ratio 1:1:√2 for a 45°–45°–90° triangle, or 1:√3:2 for a 30°–60°–90° triangle, matching sides to the marked angles. Therefore $x=45^\\circ$ and $y=12\\sqrt2$.","answerAr":"نستعمل النسبة $1:1:\\sqrt2$ للمثلث $45^\\circ,45^\\circ,90^\\circ$ أو $1:\\sqrt3:2$ للمثلث $30^\\circ,60^\\circ,90^\\circ$، مع مطابقة الأضلاع للزوايا. النتيجة $x=45^\\circ$ و$y=12\\sqrt2$.","options":["$\\begin{gathered}x=45^\\circ\\\\y=12\\sqrt2\\end{gathered}$","$\\begin{gathered}x=12\\sqrt2\\\\y=45^\\circ\\end{gathered}$","$\\begin{gathered}x=90^\\circ\\\\y=12\\sqrt2\\end{gathered}$","$\\begin{gathered}x=45^\\circ\\\\y=24\\sqrt2\\end{gathered}$"],"optionsAr":["$\\begin{gathered}x=45^\\circ\\\\y=12\\sqrt2\\end{gathered}$","$\\begin{gathered}x=12\\sqrt2\\\\y=45^\\circ\\end{gathered}$","$\\begin{gathered}x=90^\\circ\\\\y=12\\sqrt2\\end{gathered}$","$\\begin{gathered}x=45^\\circ\\\\y=24\\sqrt2\\end{gathered}$"],"sourcePage":185,"sourceQuestion":38,"rightTriangleDiagram":{"kind":"square","number":38},"specialTriangle":{"expected":[45,16.970562748477143],"choiceValues":[[45,16.970562748477143],[16.970562748477143,45],[90,16.970562748477143],[45,33.941125496954285]]},"correctIndex":0}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10a1-w10-p184-q25',$question_json${"id":"10a1-w10-p184-q25","classroom":"10A1","examWeek":10,"exam":"10A1 · 10th week practice","topic":"Use the properties of 45°–45°–90° and 30°–60°–90° triangles","type":"MCQ","marks":1,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"A 40-foot escalator makes a $30^\\circ$ angle with the horizontal. How high is the second floor above the first floor?","promptAr":"سلم كهربائي طوله 40 قدماً يصنع زاوية $30^\\circ$ مع الأفقي. ما ارتفاع الطابق الثاني عن الأول؟","answer":"The height is opposite $30^\\circ$, so it is half the hypotenuse: $40/2=20$ feet.","answerAr":"الارتفاع يقابل زاوية $30^\\circ$، لذا يساوي نصف الوتر: $40/2=20$ قدماً.","options":["$40\\sqrt3$ ft","$20$ ft","$40$ ft","$20\\sqrt3$ ft"],"optionsAr":["$40\\sqrt3$ قدماً","20 قدماً","40 قدماً","$20\\sqrt3$ قدماً"],"sourcePage":184,"sourceQuestion":25,"rightTriangleDiagram":{"kind":"right","legs":[20,34.64101615137754],"labels":["height","horizontal","40"],"angleC":30},"specialTriangle":{"expected":[20],"choiceValues":[[69.28203230275508],[20],[40],[34.64101615137754]]},"correctIndex":1}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10a1-w10-coordinate-q13',$question_json${"id":"10a1-w10-coordinate-q13","classroom":"10A1","examWeek":10,"exam":"10A1 · 10th week practice","topic":"Find midpoints and distances in three-dimensional coordinates","type":"FRQ","marks":3,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Given $K(-2,-4,-4)$ and $L(4,2,0)$, find the coordinates of midpoint M. Show the three-dimensional formula and your working.","promptAr":"للنقطتين $K(-2,-4,-4)$ و$L(4,2,0)$، أوجد إحداثيات منتصف القطعة M. اكتب الصيغة في الفراغ وخطوات الحل.","answer":"$M=(\\frac{x_1+x_2}{2},\\frac{y_1+y_2}{2},\\frac{z_1+z_2}{2})=(1,-1,-2)$. ","answerAr":"نأخذ متوسط كل زوج من الإحداثيات: $M=(\\frac{x_1+x_2}{2},\\frac{y_1+y_2}{2},\\frac{z_1+z_2}{2})=(1,-1,-2)$. ","options":[],"optionsAr":[],"sourceQuestion":13,"sourceReference":"Supplied three-dimensional coordinate exercises; page unspecified. Routed to confirmed FRQ outcome Q24.","responseParts":[{"label":"Formula and substitution · الصيغة والتعويض"},{"label":"Midpoint coordinates · إحداثيات منتصف القطعة"}],"spatial3D":{"points":[[-2,-4,-4],[4,2,0]],"midpoint":[1,-1,-2]}}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10a1-w10-coordinate-q14',$question_json${"id":"10a1-w10-coordinate-q14","classroom":"10A1","examWeek":10,"exam":"10A1 · 10th week practice","topic":"Find midpoints and distances in three-dimensional coordinates","type":"FRQ","marks":3,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Given $W(-1,-3,-6)$ and $Z(-1,5,10)$, find the coordinates of midpoint M. Show the three-dimensional formula and your working.","promptAr":"للنقطتين $W(-1,-3,-6)$ و$Z(-1,5,10)$، أوجد إحداثيات منتصف القطعة M. اكتب الصيغة في الفراغ وخطوات الحل.","answer":"$M=(\\frac{x_1+x_2}{2},\\frac{y_1+y_2}{2},\\frac{z_1+z_2}{2})=(-1,1,2)$. ","answerAr":"نأخذ متوسط كل زوج من الإحداثيات: $M=(\\frac{x_1+x_2}{2},\\frac{y_1+y_2}{2},\\frac{z_1+z_2}{2})=(-1,1,2)$. ","options":[],"optionsAr":[],"sourceQuestion":14,"sourceReference":"Supplied three-dimensional coordinate exercises; page unspecified. Routed to confirmed FRQ outcome Q24.","responseParts":[{"label":"Formula and substitution · الصيغة والتعويض"},{"label":"Midpoint coordinates · إحداثيات منتصف القطعة"}],"spatial3D":{"points":[[-1,-3,-6],[-1,5,10]],"midpoint":[-1,1,2]}}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10a1-w10-coordinate-q15',$question_json${"id":"10a1-w10-coordinate-q15","classroom":"10A1","examWeek":10,"exam":"10A1 · 10th week practice","topic":"Find midpoints and distances in three-dimensional coordinates","type":"FRQ","marks":3,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Given $R(3,3,4)$ and $V(5,4,13)$, find the coordinates of midpoint M. Show the three-dimensional formula and your working.","promptAr":"للنقطتين $R(3,3,4)$ و$V(5,4,13)$، أوجد إحداثيات منتصف القطعة M. اكتب الصيغة في الفراغ وخطوات الحل.","answer":"$M=(\\frac{x_1+x_2}{2},\\frac{y_1+y_2}{2},\\frac{z_1+z_2}{2})=(4,\\frac72,\\frac{17}{2})$. ","answerAr":"نأخذ متوسط كل زوج من الإحداثيات: $M=(\\frac{x_1+x_2}{2},\\frac{y_1+y_2}{2},\\frac{z_1+z_2}{2})=(4,\\frac72,\\frac{17}{2})$. ","options":[],"optionsAr":[],"sourceQuestion":15,"sourceReference":"Supplied three-dimensional coordinate exercises; page unspecified. Routed to confirmed FRQ outcome Q24.","responseParts":[{"label":"Formula and substitution · الصيغة والتعويض"},{"label":"Midpoint coordinates · إحداثيات منتصف القطعة"}],"spatial3D":{"points":[[3,3,4],[5,4,13]],"midpoint":[4,3.5,8.5]}}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10a1-w10-coordinate-q16',$question_json${"id":"10a1-w10-coordinate-q16","classroom":"10A1","examWeek":10,"exam":"10A1 · 10th week practice","topic":"Find midpoints and distances in three-dimensional coordinates","type":"FRQ","marks":3,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Given $A(4,6,-8)$ and $B(0,0,0)$, find the coordinates of midpoint M. Show the three-dimensional formula and your working.","promptAr":"للنقطتين $A(4,6,-8)$ و$B(0,0,0)$، أوجد إحداثيات منتصف القطعة M. اكتب الصيغة في الفراغ وخطوات الحل.","answer":"$M=(\\frac{x_1+x_2}{2},\\frac{y_1+y_2}{2},\\frac{z_1+z_2}{2})=(2,3,-4)$. ","answerAr":"نأخذ متوسط كل زوج من الإحداثيات: $M=(\\frac{x_1+x_2}{2},\\frac{y_1+y_2}{2},\\frac{z_1+z_2}{2})=(2,3,-4)$. ","options":[],"optionsAr":[],"sourceQuestion":16,"sourceReference":"Supplied three-dimensional coordinate exercises; page unspecified. Routed to confirmed FRQ outcome Q24.","responseParts":[{"label":"Formula and substitution · الصيغة والتعويض"},{"label":"Midpoint coordinates · إحداثيات منتصف القطعة"}],"spatial3D":{"points":[[4,6,-8],[0,0,0]],"midpoint":[2,3,-4]}}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10a1-w10-coordinate-q17',$question_json${"id":"10a1-w10-coordinate-q17","classroom":"10A1","examWeek":10,"exam":"10A1 · 10th week practice","topic":"Find midpoints and distances in three-dimensional coordinates","type":"FRQ","marks":3,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Given $C(8,7,11)$ and $D(2,1,8)$, find the coordinates of midpoint M. Show the three-dimensional formula and your working.","promptAr":"للنقطتين $C(8,7,11)$ و$D(2,1,8)$، أوجد إحداثيات منتصف القطعة M. اكتب الصيغة في الفراغ وخطوات الحل.","answer":"$M=(\\frac{x_1+x_2}{2},\\frac{y_1+y_2}{2},\\frac{z_1+z_2}{2})=(5,4,\\frac{19}{2})$. ","answerAr":"نأخذ متوسط كل زوج من الإحداثيات: $M=(\\frac{x_1+x_2}{2},\\frac{y_1+y_2}{2},\\frac{z_1+z_2}{2})=(5,4,\\frac{19}{2})$. ","options":[],"optionsAr":[],"sourceQuestion":17,"sourceReference":"Supplied three-dimensional coordinate exercises; page unspecified. Routed to confirmed FRQ outcome Q24.","responseParts":[{"label":"Formula and substitution · الصيغة والتعويض"},{"label":"Midpoint coordinates · إحداثيات منتصف القطعة"}],"spatial3D":{"points":[[8,7,11],[2,1,8]],"midpoint":[5,4,9.5]}}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10a1-w10-coordinate-q18',$question_json${"id":"10a1-w10-coordinate-q18","classroom":"10A1","examWeek":10,"exam":"10A1 · 10th week practice","topic":"Find midpoints and distances in three-dimensional coordinates","type":"FRQ","marks":3,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Given $T(-1,-7,9)$ and $U(5,-1,-6)$, find the coordinates of midpoint M. Show the three-dimensional formula and your working.","promptAr":"للنقطتين $T(-1,-7,9)$ و$U(5,-1,-6)$، أوجد إحداثيات منتصف القطعة M. اكتب الصيغة في الفراغ وخطوات الحل.","answer":"$M=(\\frac{x_1+x_2}{2},\\frac{y_1+y_2}{2},\\frac{z_1+z_2}{2})=(2,-4,\\frac32)$. ","answerAr":"نأخذ متوسط كل زوج من الإحداثيات: $M=(\\frac{x_1+x_2}{2},\\frac{y_1+y_2}{2},\\frac{z_1+z_2}{2})=(2,-4,\\frac32)$. ","options":[],"optionsAr":[],"sourceQuestion":18,"sourceReference":"Supplied three-dimensional coordinate exercises; page unspecified. Routed to confirmed FRQ outcome Q24.","responseParts":[{"label":"Formula and substitution · الصيغة والتعويض"},{"label":"Midpoint coordinates · إحداثيات منتصف القطعة"}],"spatial3D":{"points":[[-1,-7,9],[5,-1,-6]],"midpoint":[2,-4,1.5]}}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10a1-w10-coordinate-q19',$question_json${"id":"10a1-w10-coordinate-q19","classroom":"10A1","examWeek":10,"exam":"10A1 · 10th week practice","topic":"Find midpoints and distances in three-dimensional coordinates","type":"FRQ","marks":4,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Given $P(-5,-2,-1)$ and $Q(-1,0,3)$, find the distance between the points and the coordinates of midpoint M. Show the three-dimensional formula and your working.","promptAr":"للنقطتين $P(-5,-2,-1)$ و$Q(-1,0,3)$، أوجد المسافة بينهما وإحداثيات منتصف القطعة M. اكتب الصيغة في الفراغ وخطوات الحل.","answer":"$M=(\\frac{x_1+x_2}{2},\\frac{y_1+y_2}{2},\\frac{z_1+z_2}{2})=(-3,-1,1)$. Also $d=\\sqrt{(x_2-x_1)^2+(y_2-y_1)^2+(z_2-z_1)^2}=6$.","answerAr":"نأخذ متوسط كل زوج من الإحداثيات: $M=(\\frac{x_1+x_2}{2},\\frac{y_1+y_2}{2},\\frac{z_1+z_2}{2})=(-3,-1,1)$. والمسافة $d=\\sqrt{(x_2-x_1)^2+(y_2-y_1)^2+(z_2-z_1)^2}=6$.","options":[],"optionsAr":[],"sourceQuestion":19,"sourceReference":"Supplied three-dimensional coordinate exercises; page unspecified. Routed to confirmed FRQ outcome Q24.","responseParts":[{"label":"Formula and substitution · الصيغة والتعويض"},{"label":"Exact distance · المسافة الدقيقة"},{"label":"Midpoint coordinates · إحداثيات منتصف القطعة"}],"spatial3D":{"points":[[-5,-2,-1],[-1,0,3]],"midpoint":[-3,-1,1],"distance":6}}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10a1-w10-coordinate-q20',$question_json${"id":"10a1-w10-coordinate-q20","classroom":"10A1","examWeek":10,"exam":"10A1 · 10th week practice","topic":"Find midpoints and distances in three-dimensional coordinates","type":"FRQ","marks":4,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Given $J(1,1,1)$ and $K(-1,-1,-1)$, find the distance between the points and the coordinates of midpoint M. Show the three-dimensional formula and your working.","promptAr":"للنقطتين $J(1,1,1)$ و$K(-1,-1,-1)$، أوجد المسافة بينهما وإحداثيات منتصف القطعة M. اكتب الصيغة في الفراغ وخطوات الحل.","answer":"$M=(\\frac{x_1+x_2}{2},\\frac{y_1+y_2}{2},\\frac{z_1+z_2}{2})=(0,0,0)$. Also $d=\\sqrt{(x_2-x_1)^2+(y_2-y_1)^2+(z_2-z_1)^2}=2\\sqrt3$.","answerAr":"نأخذ متوسط كل زوج من الإحداثيات: $M=(\\frac{x_1+x_2}{2},\\frac{y_1+y_2}{2},\\frac{z_1+z_2}{2})=(0,0,0)$. والمسافة $d=\\sqrt{(x_2-x_1)^2+(y_2-y_1)^2+(z_2-z_1)^2}=2\\sqrt3$.","options":[],"optionsAr":[],"sourceQuestion":20,"sourceReference":"Supplied three-dimensional coordinate exercises; page unspecified. Routed to confirmed FRQ outcome Q24.","responseParts":[{"label":"Formula and substitution · الصيغة والتعويض"},{"label":"Exact distance · المسافة الدقيقة"},{"label":"Midpoint coordinates · إحداثيات منتصف القطعة"}],"spatial3D":{"points":[[1,1,1],[-1,-1,-1]],"midpoint":[0,0,0],"distance":3.4641016151377544}}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10a1-w10-coordinate-q21',$question_json${"id":"10a1-w10-coordinate-q21","classroom":"10A1","examWeek":10,"exam":"10A1 · 10th week practice","topic":"Find midpoints and distances in three-dimensional coordinates","type":"FRQ","marks":4,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Given $F(\\frac35,0,\\frac45)$ and $G(0,0,0)$, find the distance between the points and the coordinates of midpoint M. Show the three-dimensional formula and your working.","promptAr":"للنقطتين $F(\\frac35,0,\\frac45)$ و$G(0,0,0)$، أوجد المسافة بينهما وإحداثيات منتصف القطعة M. اكتب الصيغة في الفراغ وخطوات الحل.","answer":"$M=(\\frac{x_1+x_2}{2},\\frac{y_1+y_2}{2},\\frac{z_1+z_2}{2})=(\\frac3{10},0,\\frac25)$. Also $d=\\sqrt{(x_2-x_1)^2+(y_2-y_1)^2+(z_2-z_1)^2}=1$.","answerAr":"نأخذ متوسط كل زوج من الإحداثيات: $M=(\\frac{x_1+x_2}{2},\\frac{y_1+y_2}{2},\\frac{z_1+z_2}{2})=(\\frac3{10},0,\\frac25)$. والمسافة $d=\\sqrt{(x_2-x_1)^2+(y_2-y_1)^2+(z_2-z_1)^2}=1$.","options":[],"optionsAr":[],"sourceQuestion":21,"sourceReference":"Supplied three-dimensional coordinate exercises; page unspecified. Routed to confirmed FRQ outcome Q24.","responseParts":[{"label":"Formula and substitution · الصيغة والتعويض"},{"label":"Exact distance · المسافة الدقيقة"},{"label":"Midpoint coordinates · إحداثيات منتصف القطعة"}],"spatial3D":{"points":[[0.6,0,0.8],[0,0,0]],"midpoint":[0.3,0,0.4],"distance":1}}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10a1-w10-coordinate-q22',$question_json${"id":"10a1-w10-coordinate-q22","classroom":"10A1","examWeek":10,"exam":"10A1 · 10th week practice","topic":"Find midpoints and distances in three-dimensional coordinates","type":"FRQ","marks":4,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Given $G(1,-1,6)$ and $H(\\frac15,-\\frac25,2)$, find the distance between the points and the coordinates of midpoint M. Show the three-dimensional formula and your working.","promptAr":"للنقطتين $G(1,-1,6)$ و$H(\\frac15,-\\frac25,2)$، أوجد المسافة بينهما وإحداثيات منتصف القطعة M. اكتب الصيغة في الفراغ وخطوات الحل.","answer":"$M=(\\frac{x_1+x_2}{2},\\frac{y_1+y_2}{2},\\frac{z_1+z_2}{2})=(\\frac35,-\\frac7{10},4)$. Also $d=\\sqrt{(x_2-x_1)^2+(y_2-y_1)^2+(z_2-z_1)^2}=\\sqrt{17}$.","answerAr":"نأخذ متوسط كل زوج من الإحداثيات: $M=(\\frac{x_1+x_2}{2},\\frac{y_1+y_2}{2},\\frac{z_1+z_2}{2})=(\\frac35,-\\frac7{10},4)$. والمسافة $d=\\sqrt{(x_2-x_1)^2+(y_2-y_1)^2+(z_2-z_1)^2}=\\sqrt{17}$.","options":[],"optionsAr":[],"sourceQuestion":22,"sourceReference":"Supplied three-dimensional coordinate exercises; page unspecified. Routed to confirmed FRQ outcome Q24.","responseParts":[{"label":"Formula and substitution · الصيغة والتعويض"},{"label":"Exact distance · المسافة الدقيقة"},{"label":"Midpoint coordinates · إحداثيات منتصف القطعة"}],"spatial3D":{"points":[[1,-1,6],[0.2,-0.4,2]],"midpoint":[0.6,-0.7,4],"distance":4.123105625617661}}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10a1-w10-coordinate-q23',$question_json${"id":"10a1-w10-coordinate-q23","classroom":"10A1","examWeek":10,"exam":"10A1 · 10th week practice","topic":"Find midpoints and distances in three-dimensional coordinates","type":"FRQ","marks":4,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Given $B(\\sqrt3,2,2\\sqrt2)$ and $C(-2\\sqrt3,4,4\\sqrt2)$, find the distance between the points and the coordinates of midpoint M. Show the three-dimensional formula and your working.","promptAr":"للنقطتين $B(\\sqrt3,2,2\\sqrt2)$ و$C(-2\\sqrt3,4,4\\sqrt2)$، أوجد المسافة بينهما وإحداثيات منتصف القطعة M. اكتب الصيغة في الفراغ وخطوات الحل.","answer":"$M=(\\frac{x_1+x_2}{2},\\frac{y_1+y_2}{2},\\frac{z_1+z_2}{2})=(-\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2},3,3\\sqrt2)$. Also $d=\\sqrt{(x_2-x_1)^2+(y_2-y_1)^2+(z_2-z_1)^2}=\\sqrt{39}$.","answerAr":"نأخذ متوسط كل زوج من الإحداثيات: $M=(\\frac{x_1+x_2}{2},\\frac{y_1+y_2}{2},\\frac{z_1+z_2}{2})=(-\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2},3,3\\sqrt2)$. والمسافة $d=\\sqrt{(x_2-x_1)^2+(y_2-y_1)^2+(z_2-z_1)^2}=\\sqrt{39}$.","options":[],"optionsAr":[],"sourceQuestion":23,"sourceReference":"Supplied three-dimensional coordinate exercises; page unspecified. Routed to confirmed FRQ outcome Q24.","responseParts":[{"label":"Formula and substitution · الصيغة والتعويض"},{"label":"Exact distance · المسافة الدقيقة"},{"label":"Midpoint coordinates · إحداثيات منتصف القطعة"}],"spatial3D":{"points":[[1.7320508075688772,2,2.8284271247461903],[-3.4641016151377544,4,5.656854249492381]],"midpoint":[-0.8660254037844386,3,4.242640687119286],"distance":6.244997998398398}}$question_json$::jsonb),
('10a1-w10-coordinate-q24',$question_json${"id":"10a1-w10-coordinate-q24","classroom":"10A1","examWeek":10,"exam":"10A1 · 10th week practice","topic":"Find midpoints and distances in three-dimensional coordinates","type":"FRQ","marks":4,"difficulty":"Standard","diagram":"none","image":"","prompt":"Given $S(6\\sqrt3,4,4\\sqrt2)$ and $T(4\\sqrt3,5,\\sqrt2)$, find the distance between the points and the coordinates of midpoint M. Show the three-dimensional formula and your working.","promptAr":"للنقطتين $S(6\\sqrt3,4,4\\sqrt2)$ و$T(4\\sqrt3,5,\\sqrt2)$، أوجد المسافة بينهما وإحداثيات منتصف القطعة M. اكتب الصيغة في الفراغ وخطوات الحل.","answer":"$M=(\\frac{x_1+x_2}{2},\\frac{y_1+y_2}{2},\\frac{z_1+z_2}{2})=(5\\sqrt3,\\frac92,\\frac{5\\sqrt2}{2})$. Also $d=\\sqrt{(x_2-x_1)^2+(y_2-y_1)^2+(z_2-z_1)^2}=\\sqrt{31}$.","answerAr":"نأخذ متوسط كل زوج من الإحداثيات: $M=(\\frac{x_1+x_2}{2},\\frac{y_1+y_2}{2},\\frac{z_1+z_2}{2})=(5\\sqrt3,\\frac92,\\frac{5\\sqrt2}{2})$. والمسافة $d=\\sqrt{(x_2-x_1)^2+(y_2-y_1)^2+(z_2-z_1)^2}=\\sqrt{31}$.","options":[],"optionsAr":[],"sourceQuestion":24,"sourceReference":"Supplied three-dimensional coordinate exercises; page unspecified. Routed to confirmed FRQ outcome Q24.","responseParts":[{"label":"Formula and substitution · الصيغة والتعويض"},{"label":"Exact distance · المسافة الدقيقة"},{"label":"Midpoint coordinates · إحداثيات منتصف القطعة"}],"spatial3D":{"points":[[10.392304845413264,4,5.656854249492381],[6.928203230275509,5,1.4142135623730951]],"midpoint":[8.660254037844386,4.5,3.5355339059327378],"distance":5.567764362830022}}$question_json$::jsonb)
